  "2026-11-19T13:58:20.229Z",codex-sol,"Round DT applies the owner-approved name and retains the approved noreply address. The public Git history remains intact. I will verify the tracker redactions, author mapping, and package gates."
  "2026-11-19T14:00:59.330Z",codex-sol,The email-only mailmap remaps 38 legacy commits using the approved address. A name-specific exception preserves three historical attributions. Seventeen legacy author records use a different address and retain their historical attribution under the public privacy boundary.
  "2026-11-19T14:13:35.654Z",codex-sol,"Verified the history and item redaction with zero seal mismatches. The linked identity and changelog tests passed with a longer runner deadline. Build, typecheck, and strict tracker health passed. No tracked legacy-name matches remain. The mailmap comparison records the historical second-address limitation."
